<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-TUESDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-TUESDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round</p>
<p>National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Tuesday</p>
<p>(home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		   EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Buffalo     3  OTTAWA		 2</p>
<p>(Buffalo wins best-of-seven series)</p>
<p>		   WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Edmonton    4  DALLAS		 3</p>
<p>(Edmonton wins best-of-seven series 4-3)</p>
<p> Anaheim     3  PHOENIX		0</p>
<p>(Anaheim wins best-of-seven series 4-3)</p>
</text>
